      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;confidence-and-personal-style-slang&#34;&gt;Confidence and Personal Style (Slang)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Definition:&lt;/strong&gt; An effortless, bold, and self-assured appearance, attitude, or swagger (derived as a shortening of &lt;em&gt;swagger&lt;/em&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;ldquo;He walks into the room with total swag.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
